WHY SEPARATE
------------
The long-term intent is to publish this knowledge base as a standalone, citable
dataset that other projects can consume. A software licence applied to a dataset
creates ambiguity for exactly that reuse (ADR-0017, PROJECT_VISION.md Stage 4).

NO WARRANTY
-----------
This content is provided for educational and informational purposes. It is not
medical advice and does not determine allergen safety. Every threshold and
additive record carries a citation in `sources.json`; consult the primary
sources for authoritative guidance.
